/*
 * AREE :: run configuration for WANG2026_ERK_HEAT (PXD065668, PXD065706)
 *
 * NOT RUN. Registered only (2026-10-17): quantification exists only as
 * proprietary Spectronaut archives and significance-filtered tables, and the
 * proteome runs were acquired in condition blocks. See
